    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda era yaakoba ati: “Omulyango ogwingira mu luya olw'omunda ogulingiriire ku luuyi olw'e buvandhuba gwidha kubanga mwigale mu nnaku omukaaga dhe bakoleraku emirimo. Aye gwidha kwigulwanga ku lunaku lwa Sabbato, ni ku lunaku olw'okuboneka kw'omwezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga aidha kwingiranga mu mulyango ogwo ng'aviira ku luya olw'okuliya, yaabitira mu kisasi eky'oku mulyango. Aidha kwemereranga gha bikondo eby'omulyango ogwingira mu luya olw'omunda, nga bakabona bali kughaayo ku lulwe ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa n'ebigheebwayo olw'okutabagana. Era kyabazinga oyo aidha kusinzizanga agho gha mulyango, memale afulume. Aye omulyango gwidha kusigalanga nga mwigule okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli ku Sabbato ni ku kuboneka kw'omwezi, abantu boonaboona baidha kunsinzanga nze Musengwa Katonda nga bali agho gha mulyango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kyabazinga aidha kuleetanga ye ndi nze Musengwa Katonda ku Sabbato, entaama ento mukaaga n'entaama enume ndala, edhiziraku kikyamu kyonakyona, adhigheeyo ng'ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku buli ntaama nume aidha kuteerangaku ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke, nga kya kilo ikumi na musanvu n'ekitundu. Ate ku buli ntaama nto aidha kuteerangaku obuzito obw'ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke bwonabwona bw'anaasobolanga. Aye nga ku buli kigheebwayo kya mere ya mpeke, aleeteraku ni lita isatu edh'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku Kibinuko eky'Okuboneka kw'Omwezi, kyabazinga aidha kughangayo ekigheebwayo nga kya nte enume ndala entototo, n'entaama ento mukaaga, n'entaama enume ndala, edhiziraku kikyamu kyonakyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku buli nte nume ni ku buli ntaama nume, aidha kuteerangaku ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke, nga kya kilo ikumi na musanvu n'ekitundu. Ate ku buli ntaama nto aidha kuteerangaku obuzito obw'ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke bwonabwona bw'anaasobolanga. Aye nga ku buli kigheebwayo kya mere ya mpeke, aleeteraku ni lita isatu edh'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga aidha kwingiranga ng'abitira mu kisasi eky'oku mulyango, era mwene omwo mw'anaabitanga okufuluma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abantu bwe banaidhanga okunsinza nze Musengwa Katonda ku mbaga edh'ebibinuko ebyalagirwa, ghazira anaafulumiranga mu mulyango gwangiriiremu. Kiisi anangiriranga mu mulyango oguli ku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba, aidha kufulumiranga mu mulyango oguli ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba. Ate kiisi anangiriranga mu mulyango oguli ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba, aidha kufulumiranga mu mulyango oguli ku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga aidha kwingiriranga ghalala n'abantu nga bali kwingira. Era aidha kufulumiranga ghalala nabo nga bali kufuluma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mbaga edh'ebibinuko ebyalagirwa ni ku nnaku enkulu, omuntu aidha kughangayo ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke nga kya buzito bwa kilo ikumi na musanvu n'ekitundu, ku buli nte enume ento ni ku buli ntaama enume. Ate ku buli ntaama ento aidha kuteerangaku obuzito obw'ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke bwonabwona bw'anaasobolanga. Aye nga ku buli kigheebwayo kya mere ya mpeke, aleeteraku ni lita isatu edh'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kyabazinga bw'anaayendanga okughaayo ekigheebwayo eky'ekyeyendere eri nze Musengwa Katonda, ka kibe ekyokebwa kyonakyona okuwaagho oba ekigheebwayo olw'okutabagana, baidha kumwigulirangagho omulyango ogulingiriire e buvandhuba. Aidha kughangayo ekigheebwayo kye ekyokebwa kyonakyona okuwaagho, n'ekigheebwayo kye olw'okutabagana, ng'oti ni bw'akola ku nnaku dha Sabbato. Bw'anaamalanga aidha kufulumanga, omulyango ogwo bagwigalengagho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Buli lunaku mwidha kutegekangagho entaama ento ndala ey'omwaka omulala, ng'eziraku kikyamu kyonakyona, bagighengayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda ng'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa kyonakyona okuwaagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo mwidha kuleeterangaku buli lunaku, kilo ibiri edh'obuwunga ni lita ndala ey'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva ogw'okutabula mu buwunga obwo ekyo kibe ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke. Eiteeka erigema ku kigheebwayo kino liidha kubangagho byanda na byanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale entaama ento, n'obuwunga, n'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva, biidha kugheebwangayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda buli nkyo, ng'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa eky'ebyanda n'ebyanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Kyabazinga bw'anaaghanga mutabane we ekirabo ku itaka lye yasikira, eitaka eryo linaabanga lya baana ba mutabane we oyo, nga lya nsikirano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 25:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aye kyabazinga bw'anaaghanga owundi ku bagheereza be ekirabo ku itaka lye yasikira, eitaka eryo linaabanga ly'oyo y'alighaire okutuuka mu mwaka omutukuvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:17:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mu mwaka omutukuvu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Buli luvainhuma lwa myaka makumi ataanu, Abaisiraeli boonaboona abaalinga nga bafuuliibwa bairu olw'amabandha ge beewolanga okubalema okusasula, baalinga n'okulekulwa babe ba idembe. Era baalinga n'okwizaayo eitaka lyonalyona ery'ensikirano lye baatunda olw'amabandha, balighe beene lyo oba abasika baibwe ( Lev 25:8-55).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Olwo lyamala lyairira kyabazinga kuba batabane ba kyabazinga bonka n'abasobola okutwalira irala eitaka ni liba lyaibwe, kyabazinga lye yasikira aye n'alibagha ng'ekirabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era kyabazinga taatoolenga itaka lya bantu bandi n'alibabingamu. Eitaka ly'anaaghangaku abaana be liidha kubanga eryo lye yafuna ng'obusika bwe. Olwo alobe kutuntuzanga bantu bange ng'ababinga mu itaka lyaibwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho omusaadha yantwala gh'oingirira ebizimbe ebiringiriire ku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba, okumpi n'omulyango ogwingira mu luya olw'omunda oguli ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba. Ebyo nga n'ebizimbe ebitukuvu ebya bakabona. Agho ku luuyi olw'e bugwandhuba olw'ebizimbe ebyo aghasemberayo irala naabonayo ekifo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
