            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaadha yankoba ati: “Kino n'ekifo bakabona mwe banaafumbiranga emamba ey'ebigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'ey'ebigheebwayo ng'omutango. Era mwe banaakalangiranga n'ebigheebwayo eby'emere ey'empeke. Olwo balobenga kubifulumya mu luya olw'okuliya, kuba obutukuvu bwabyo busobola okukola akabi ku bantu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:20:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "okukola akabi ...:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abantu baali bakikakasa ng'omuntu atali kabona bw'agema ku kintu ekitukuvu kisobola okumutusaaku akabi ( Ezek 44:19).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
